anges in parentheses. Differences are shown from healthy controls as <sup>a</sup><italic>P</italic>&#x0003c;0.05 and <sup>b</sup><italic>P</italic>&#x0003c;0.001.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>